Source: macavity
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/CrystallineCore/Macavity

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-macavity
Architecture: any
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Deterministic fault injection for PostgreSQL test clusters
 macavity injects session-local errors, delays and backend crashes at named
 PostgreSQL execution points. This destructive testing extension is intended
 only for development and disposable test clusters.
